    {
      "text": "God saw … every imagination of the thoughts of his heart, Gen. 6:5. I know him, that he will command his children, Gen. 18:19. Lord is a God of knowledge, 1 Sam. 2:3. Lord looketh on the heart, 1 Sam. 16:7. Lord searcheth all hearts, and understandeth all, 1 Chr. 28:9. thou only knowest the hearts of the children of men, 2 Chr. 6:30 (Acts 1:24; 15:8). he knoweth the way that I take, Job 23:10. he knoweth the secrets of the heart, Ps. 44:21 (Luke 16:15). Lord knoweth the thoughts of man, Ps. 94:11. Thou … art acquainted with all my ways, Ps. 139:3. Great is our Lord … his understanding is infinite, Ps. 147:5. eyes of the Lord are in every place, Prov. 15:3. I know their works and their thoughts, Isa. 66:18. thou, O Lord, knowest me, Jer. 12:3. I the Lord search the heart, Jer. 17:10 (Rev. 2:23). I know the things that come into your mind, Ezek. 11:5.",
